<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">Vidunda Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa ya Keli ya Paoli kwa wanhu wa Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Watesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tes</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa ya Keli ya Paoli kwa wanhu wa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tesalonike</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa ya keli kwa Watesalonike nayandichigwa na mtumigwa Paoli (2 Watesalonike 1:1). Nakandika baluwa ayi mhela udo hela kulawa hala loyandiche baluwa ya mwaluko kuli mhela wa miyaka makumi gahano na umwe Yesu loyapondigwe. Paoli nayali Kolinto mhela loyandiche baluwa ayi kuli chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu ako Tesalonike. Yuye ndo yaluchize chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu kuli majendo ga keli ga mijito ja Nguluwi (Madito 17:1-9). Nayandichigwa kuli chitabu cha Madito ga watumigwa kota nakwali na Wayahudi na Wagilichi wenji kuli chilundo acho.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chilundo cha walingumkunda Kilistu ako Tesalonike nachali chiwika goya kwa mhela wa kuhiluka kwa Yesu Kilistu, kwa vila Paoli nakandika menji kuli baluwa zeng'ha mbili zoyandiche kwa Watesalonike. Kota nusu ya baluwa ya keli kwa Watesalonike yanguwala mhela wa kuduma. Paoli kahi nakawakanya kwa mbuli ya ugata. Chila munhu kanguganigwa yakole mijito kwa kipalila chilyo cha heye (2 Watesalonike 3:6-10).</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali mgati</para>
  <para style="io">1. Paoli kangwaluka baluwa kwa kizelesa yuye na wayage kuli sula ya 1:1-2.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Kahi kangulonga malumbo kwa Nguluwi kwa chiwalo cha chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu ako Tesalonike na kulanda kwa chiwalo cha hewo (2 Watesalonike 1:3-12).</para>
  <para style="io">3. Kuli sula ya keli Paoli kangulonga kuwala mhela wa kuduma.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Hamba kangulonga kwa chiwalo cha mbuli ya ugata na mbuli ya kukola mijito (2 Watesalonike 3:1-15).</para>
  <para style="io">5. Kuduma Paoli kanguwalamsa wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu kahi (2 Watesalonike 3:16-18).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Heni Paoli hamwe na Silivani na Timoteyi, twanguwandichila hemwe chilundo cha wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu ako Tesalonike, wawele ndo wanhu wa Nguluwi Mhaza wa hetwe na wa Mkulu Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Twangulanda kwa Nguluwi mhaza wa hetwe na kwa Mkulu Yesu Kilistu kwa chiwalo cha hemwe, yawape isungu lya heye na kikala goya.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Utaguso mhela wa kuya kwa Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Wang'holozetu, twanguganigwa kulonga malumbo kwa Nguluwi mazuwa gose kwa chiwalo cha hemwe. Igana kwa hetwe kudita ahyo kwa vila makundo ga hemwe gangukula lukami na kigana hali hemwe kwangonjezeka lukami. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Ndo chiwalo twangidaya kwa chiwalo cha hemwe hali vilundo vya wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu. Twangidaya kwa vila mwangulutilila kuli makundo na kwimilila kuli nongwa na magazo geng'ha gomlingupegwa.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Ago geng'ha gangulajila kota utaguso wa Nguluwi ndo wa hachi mazuwa gose, nawo wangudita hemwe mkundigwe kuli undewa wa heye Nguluwi uwele hemwe mwangigaya kwa chiwalo acho. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Nguluwi kodita mbuli inojile, kowahilulila magazo wala walinguwagaza hemwe, <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />na kuwadita hemwe mlingugazigwa mwesele hamwe natwe. Kodita mbuli ayo mhela Mkulu Yesu hoyolawila kulawa kilanga hamwe na wahilisi wa heye wawele na ludali. <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />Na kuwagaza kwa ilapi lya chiluli wala walingumlema Nguluwi na kahi wala wohambe waikunde Mbuli Inojile ya Mkulu wa hetwe Yesu. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Utaguso wa hewo wowa ndo kudumigwa mazuwa gose ne kuduma na kuwichigwa kutali na ukulu wa ludali lwa heye. <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Zuwa alyo hoyokuya kupegwa lutogo kulawa kwa wanhu wa heye na kutanganika kulawa kwa welile weng'ha walingukunda. Namwe mowa hali hewo, kwa vila namuukunda wula usenga woyawagalile.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Ndo chiwalo twangulanda kwa chiwalo cha hemwe mazuwa gose. Twangumlanda Nguluwi wa hetwe yawadite mikale vila vyoyawachemile mikale. Twangumlanda, kwa mong'ho wake, yeneze geng'ha ganojile gomlingugana kudita, kahi yeneze mijito ja hemwe ja makundo. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Twangulanda ahyo leka itagwa lya Mkulu wa hetwe Yesu lipegwe ukulu kulawa kwa hemwe, namwe mopegwa ukulu kulawa kwa heye kwa isungu lya Nguluwi wa hetwe na lya Mkulu Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Yula mwihe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Lelo wang'holozetu, kwa chiwalo cha kuya Mkulu wa hetwe Yesu Kilistu na kukungajizwa kwa hetwe hali heye, <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />twanguwalanda hemwe kota mleche kuwa na lunhwinhwi, kahi mleche kutinuka kwa mbuli ilingulonga kota zuwa lya Mkulu nalifika. Hanji, yangujesigwa mbuli ayo lyolawila kwa ulaguzi woneche, kudamla ama lyandiko ilingulonjigwa kota nalilawa kwa hetwe. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Mleche kukunda kuhadigwa na munhu yoneche kwa mbuli yoneche yila. Kwa vila zuwa ayo halikuya mbaka tandi zuwa lya wanhu kumbelenhuka Nguluwi kulawile na munhu yula yalinguchemigwa mwihe yoneche, yawele kuduma kwa heye ndo kubagamizwa ng'hatu. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Heye kovilema vinhu vyeng'ha viwele wanhu wanguvichema mlungu, ama chinhu walinguchifugamila naye kowa mchanya mwa chinhu acho, hanji kokwinjila na kikalisa mli Ng'handa ya Nguluwi yochidita kota heye yuye ndo Nguluwi.<verse eid="2TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Ndaze, hambe mkumbuchile kota nandiwalonjela aga geng'ha mhela wondiwele hamwe na hemwe? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Ila hana chinhu chilingumlemeza sambi, namwe mwanguchizela chinhu acho. Lelo munhu ayo mwihe kokoneka mhela wa heye uwichigwe. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Lelo munhu yula yalinguchemigwa mwihe na ludali lwake nakaluka kukola mijito sambi kwa uviso, ila hokoneka mbaka yula yawele ngumlemeza yosigwe. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Aho ndo munhu yula yalinguchemigwa mwihe hoyolawila, ila Mkulu Yesu hoyolawila komkopola kwa muhe wa mlomo wa heye na kumdumya kwa welile wa kuya kwa heye. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Ayo munhu yalinguchemigwa mwihe kokuya yawele na ludali lwa Limazoga na kudita vinduzanduza vya chila mbuli na ulajilo na kububuwaza kwa udesi, <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />na kudita uhadi kwa chila nzila kwa wala walingwajilila. Awo wokwajilila kwa vila hawakubochele na kukugana kula kukomya leka waloholigwe. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Kwa chiwalo acho, Nguluwi kawawika walongozwe na ludali lwa kuhadigwa na wakunde mbuli za udesi. <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />Ahyo wanhu weng'ha wohambe wakunde kukomya, ila wangusechelela gehile, wotagusigwa.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Namhaguligwa leka mloholigwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Twanguganigwa kumtogola Nguluwi mazuwa gose kwa chiwalo cha hemwe wang'holozetu, hemwe mlinguganigwa na Mkulu kwa vila Nguluwi nakawahagula kulawila mwaluko leka mloholigwe, kwa ludali lwa Muhe Yelile muwe wanhu wa heye welile kwa chiwalo cha hemwe kukunda ulonzi wa kukomya. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Nguluwi nakawachema kwa chiwalo cha mbuli ayi kukolela Mbuli Inojile iwele natuwadamlila, nakawachema leka namwe muwe na honhu kuli ukulu wa Mkulu wa hetwe Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Lelo wang'holozangu, muwe nzinzili na kibatilila gala malanguso gotuwalanguse kwa kudamla kwa hetwe na gala gotuwandichile.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Twangumlanda Mkulu wa hetwe Yesu Kilistu yuye na Nguluwi Mhaza wa hetwe yawele yatuganile na yatupele isungu lya heye, nakatudita tukole mbuli zinojile na kutukangaza mazuwa gose ne kuduma na kutupa utumbilo wa kukomya, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />yakangaze nhumbula za hemwe na kuwadita muwe na ludali kuli kudita na kulonga gawele ganojile.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s">Mlande kwa Nguluwi kwa chiwalo cha hetwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Hamba, wang'holozetu, mlande kwa chiwalo cha hetwe leka usenga wa Mkulu ulutilile kwenela himahima na kubocheligwa goya kota vila vyouwele hali hemwe. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Mlande kahi leka Nguluwi yatulohole na wanhu wehile na wasowile isungu, kwa vila haiwele weng'ha walingukunda usenga awu.<verse eid="2TH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Ila Mkulu ndo wakitumbila, heye kowadita mwime nzinzili na kuwamila goya na yula Mwihe. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Mkulu nakatugalila utumbilo kota mwangudita na molutilila kudita gala gotuwalonjele hemwe.<verse eid="2TH 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Mkulu yalongoze nhumbula za hemwe kuli kulizela igano lya Nguluwi na kuli kwimilila kotulingupegwa na Kilistu.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanguganigwa kukola mijito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Wang'holozangu, twanguwalajiza kwa itagwa lya Mkulu wa hetwe Yesu Kilistu, mibagule na wanhu weng'ha wawele wagata na wohambe wawinze malanguso gotuwalanguse. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Hemwe baho namvizela kota mwanguganigwa kiwhana na hetwe. Hetwe lotwali na hemwe nahatuwele wagata, <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />hatudile chilyo kwa munhu yoneche ne kumha chinhu. Natukola mijito kwa kikangaza na magazo nemisi na nechilo leka tuleche kumha munhu yoneche itunyo hali hemwe, mijito ja kutulolela. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Twahalandile kutanzwa na hemwe, ila natudita ahyo kwa vila natugana mtuwinze kuli mbuli zeng'ha. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Lotuwele hamwe na hemwe natwali tuwalonjela, “Munhu yoneche yawele halingugana kukola mijito, yaleche kulya chilyo.”<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Twangulonga mbuli ayo kwa vila natuhulika kota wabaho wamwe wa hemwe wagata na hawalingudita choneche, ila wanguwa videlenya kwa mbuli za wanhu wanji. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Kwa itagwa lya Mkulu wa hetwe Yesu Kilistu twanguwalajiza hemwe na kuwakanya wanhu awo kota wekale vyoilinguganigwa na wakole mijito leka wawe na vinhu vya kuwatanza hewo wawo.<verse eid="2TH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Ila hemwe wang'holozetu, mleche kutoka kudita ganojile. <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Wone munhu yoneche hambe yahulichize usenga awu wotuwegalile lelo mumzele munhu ayo na mumuwiche hazelu munhu ayo leka yone soni. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Ila mleche kumona munhu ayo kota mng'honyo wa hemwe, ila mumlonje kota vila mng'holozenu.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulamso wa kuduma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Mkulu yuye yalingigala kikala goya, kowapa hemwe kikala goya mazuwa gose na kwa chila nzila. Mkulu yawe na hemwe mweng'ha.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Heni Paoli, ndanguwalamsa kwa kuwandichila baluwa ayi kwa moko wa nene baha na ahi ndo vyondilinguwika ulajilo kuli chila baluwa yondiwandichile.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Isungu lya mkulu wa hetwe Yesu Kilistu liwe hamwe na hemwe mweng'ha.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>